[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_02_0002","text":"摄影师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_02_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_02_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_02_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_02_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_02_0010","text":"嗯，对对，我想要的就是这个。\n那接下来反过来，稍微柔和一点——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_02_0020","text":"（路加在工作上确实会好好回应我，但是——）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_02_0030","text":"（一旦涉及到其他事情，\n　还是……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_02_0040","text":"好——那最后，\n用自由的姿势来一张吧。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_02_0050","text":"自由地……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_02_0060","text":"把现在的心情表现出来哦。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_02_0070","text":"……──────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_02_0080","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_02_0090","text":"哦哦！很好！\n那种带着拒绝感的悲伤表情，很棒……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_02_0100","text":"（……\n　“现在路加的心情”，吗……）"}]
